        <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
             Guitar technique glyphs (24x24 viewport, fill style, same visual
             weight as the Material set above). Drawn as bold, readable
             silhouettes so they stay legible at 15-16 px in the Note
             inspector's technique chips. Notation marks (accent wedge, tremolo
             slashes, harmonic diamonds, HO/PO slurs) are hand-authored; the
             rest reuse the Material set (hand, tap gesture, diagonal arrows,
             chain link, eye-off). Used via <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource
             IconTech…}" /> — see Views/Editor/Inspector/SoundInspectorView.axaml
             and the TechniqueChip class in InspectorStyles.axaml. -->

